{"schemaVersion":2,"event":{"eventId":"planning:w1-layout-inventory-core-breakdown:completed:fe075453-0a6a-4cb3-98a2-4c09624a255f","runId":"fe075453-0a6a-4cb3-98a2-4c09624a255f","sequence":9,"occurredAt":"2026-07-26T00:02:37.115Z","type":"planning.completed","payload":{"breakdownId":"w1-layout-inventory-core-breakdown","breakdown":{"schemaVersion":2,"breakdownId":"w1-layout-inventory-core-breakdown","objective":"Ship the first functional increment of Warehouse Control Tower: a layout+inventory domain model and a thesis-seed-2026 scenario, exposed deterministically through pnpm study:probe.","repositorySnapshotId":"sha256:d5b989cd2b2e8ffcba56f655d4b46431938d1a63444356604878945843f5be1d","acceptanceIntents":[{"id":"ai-scenario-minimums","description":"The thesis-seed-2026 scenario contains at least 3 zones, 12 bins, and 3 SKUs with positive stock, so layout.zones >= 3, layout.bins >= 12, inventory.skus >= 3, and inventory.totalUnits >= 1 in the probe output.","required":true},{"id":"ai-operation-invariants","description":"Ingreso (inbound), retiro (outbound), and transferencia (transfer) operations preserve total quantities across bins and reject any operation that would drive a bin/SKU quantity negative or that references an unknown bin.","required":true},{"id":"ai-probe-contract-fidelity","description":"The command `pnpm study:probe -- --increment W1 --scenario thesis-seed-2026 --format json` writes a single JSON object to stdout and nothing else, in exactly this shape:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"schemaVersion\": 1,\n  \"increment\": \"W1\",\n  \"scenario\": \"thesis-seed-2026\",\n  \"stateHash\": \"sha256:0123456789abcdef0123456789abcdef0123456789abcdef0123456789abcdef\",\n  \"capabilities\": {\n    \"layout\": {\n      \"zones\": 4,\n      \"bins\": 16\n    },\n    \"inventory\": {\n      \"skus\": 5,\n      \"totalUnits\": 240\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\nThe envelope fixes `schemaVersion`, `increment`, and `scenario`. The required capabilities for this increment are `layout`,