s","Rejection of negative-stock results and references to unknown bins","Unit tests covering the happy path and each rejection case","A named scenario builder (thesis-seed-2026) producing a layout+inventory instance","The built scenario satisfies all four W1 minimums","Construction is deterministic — no randomness, no wall-clock dependence","Tests asserting the minimums directly against the built scenario","A study:probe pnpm script added to package.json","CLI parses --increment/--scenario/--format and resolves the named scenario","capabilities.layout/inventory are derived from the scenario's actual zone/bin/SKU/unit counts, never hardcoded","stateHash is a canonical sha256 digest over the scenario state, byte-identical across repeated invocations on the same commit","stdout contains exactly one JSON object matching the fixed envelope, no extra output"],"acceptanceIntentIds":["ai-scenario-minimums","ai-operation-invariants","ai-probe-contract-fidelity","ai-probe-determinism","ai-green-checks"],"evidenceIds":["config-package-json","script-0","script-1","script-2","stack-0","diagnostic-0"],"plannedPaths":["tsconfig.json","src/domain/layout.ts","src/domain/layout.test.ts","src/domain/inventory.ts","src/domain/inventory.test.ts","src/scenarios/thesis-seed-2026.ts","src/scenarios/thesis-seed-2026.test.ts","src/probe/cli.ts","src/probe/state-hash.ts","src/probe/cli.test.ts"],"kind":"leaf"},"candidateArtifacts":[],"candidateSeams":[],"repositoryEvidence":[{"id":"config-package-json","kind":"path","reference":"package.json","observation":"Repository package manifest defining scripts, dependencies and toolchain metadata.","confidence":1},{"id":"script-0","kind":"script","reference":"build","observation":"node -e \"console.log('empty seed build: ok')\" — placeholder stub to be replaced with a real build.","confidence":1},{"id":"script-1","kind":"script","reference":"test","observation":"node -e \"console.log('empty seed tests: ok')\" — placeholder stub to be replaced with a r