},{"id":"criterion-w1-layout-inventory-core-ai-operation-invariants-93c50270f3","kind":"integration","description":"Ingreso (inbound), retiro (outbound), and transferencia (transfer) operations preserve total quantities across bins and reject any operation that would drive a bin/SKU quantity negative or that references an unknown bin.","required":true},{"id":"criterion-w1-layout-inventory-core-ai-probe-contract-fidel-2131edccd1","kind":"integration","description":"The command `pnpm study:probe -- --increment W1 --scenario thesis-seed-2026 --format json` writes a single JSON object to stdout and nothing else, in exactly this shape:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"schemaVersion\": 1,\n  \"increment\": \"W1\",\n  \"scenario\": \"thesis-seed-2026\",\n  \"stateHash\": \"sha256:0123456789abcdef0123456789abcdef0123456789abcdef0123456789abcdef\",\n  \"capabilities\": {\n    \"layout\": {\n      \"zones\": 4,\n      \"bins\": 16\n    },\n    \"inventory\": {\n      \"skus\": 5,\n      \"totalUnits\": 240\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\nThe envelope fixes `schemaVersion`, `increment`, and `scenario`. The required capabilities for this increment are `layout`, `inventory`. Each lives nested inside `capabilities`: none is published at the top level or renamed.\n\nThe example values are illustrative. Derive them from the scenario respecting these minimums and invariants, which the external oracle verifies:\n\n- `layout.zones` is a number >= 3.\n- `layout.bins` is a number >= 12.\n- `inventory.skus` is a number >= 3.\n- `inventory.totalUnits` is a number >= 1.\n\n`stateHash` is the string `sha256:` followed by 64 lowercase hexadecimal digits.","required":true},{"id":"criterion-w1-layout-inventory-core-ai-probe-determinism-e27cd453c9","kind":"integration","description":"Two invocations of the probe over the same commit emit identical bytes; the same seed must not produce a second implementation or hardcoded fixture response.","required":true},{"id":"criterion-w1-layout-inventory-core-ai-green-checks-18bceffbc6","kind":"integration","description":"Tests, typecheck, and build all pass (real implementations, not the empty-seed stub scripts).","required":true}],"scope":{"id":"scope-contract-w1-layout-inventory-core-bb1cde6f01","revision":"sha256:595e40dbfd3e7a517d58ac6798769364e196ae5114446487a68914874131e869"},"consumes":[],"produces":[{"id":"artifact-contract-w1-layout-inventory-core-output-0ff0a85ba1","revision":"sha256:ee7964843d50b202cfa1dd565b34c96ed9bcb24db5883e36e2efccaea3bd3ba8"}],"seams":[],"validation":{"id":"validation-contract-w1-layout-inventory-core-da81063ef7","revision":"sha256:dc12e655d2d14d22d06e258bc05ac91cf8c9af6dde16255519ed1cc4d3213bfc"},"constraints":[]},"scope":{"schemaVersion":2,"id":"scope-contract-w1-layout-inventory-core-bb1cde6f01","revision":"sha256:595e40dbfd3e7a517d58ac6798769364e196ae5114446487a68914874131e869","provenance":"compiled","nodeId":"node-w1-layout-inventory-core-da059e5915","allowedPaths":["package.json","src/domain/inventory.test.ts","src/domain/inventory.ts","src/domain/layout.test.ts","src/domain/layout.ts","src/probe/cli.test.ts","src/probe/cli.ts","src/probe/state-hash.ts","src/scenarios/thesis-seed-2026.test.ts","src/scenarios/thesis-seed-2026.ts","tsconfig.json"],"forbiddenPaths":[],"coordinationPaths":[],"outputRoots":["src/domain","src/probe","src/scenarios"]},"seams":[],"artifacts":[{"schemaVersion":2,"id":"artifact-contract-w1-layout-inventory-core-output-0ff0a85ba1","revision":"sha256:ee7964843d50b202cfa1dd565b34c96ed9bcb24db5883e36e2efccaea3bd3ba8","provenance":"compiled","producerNodeId":"node-w1-layout-inventory-core-da059e5915","consumerNodeIds":[],"artifactType":"final-candidate","mediaType":"application/vnd.manyhands.git-commit","materialization":"commit","expectedPaths":["package.json","src/domain/inventory.test.ts","src/domain/inventory.ts","src/domain/layout.test.ts","src/domain/layout.ts","src/probe/cli.test.ts","src/probe/cli.ts","src/probe/state-hash.ts","src/scenarios/thesis-seed-2026.test.ts","src